WEBVTT

00:11.070 --> 00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.070 --> 00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.410 --> 00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.410 --> 00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.880 --> 00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.880 --> 00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.390 --> 00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.390 --> 00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.300 --> 00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.300 --> 00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.850 --> 00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.850 --> 00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.140 --> 00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.140 --> 00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.650 --> 00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.650 --> 00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:55.030 --> 00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:55.030 --> 00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.370 --> 01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.370 --> 01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.750 --> 01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.750 --> 01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.750 --> 01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.750 --> 01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.920 --> 01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.920 --> 01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.930 --> 01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.930 --> 01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:23.020 --> 01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:23.020 --> 01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.980 --> 01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.980 --> 01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.730 --> 01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.730 --> 01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.160 --> 01:50.580
FURFANG FULL ASSAULT

01:52.590 --> 01:55.340
Dai! Popp! I'm coming with you!

01:57.470 --> 02:02.600
If you're both disciples of Avan,
then I'm your senior.

02:03.010 --> 02:07.690
So I'm going to carry on
Master Avan's will and fight, too.

02:09.600 --> 02:10.150
Maam?

02:10.770 --> 02:12.060
Did you...?

02:15.400 --> 02:17.570
You can tell me on the way.

02:18.030 --> 02:21.200
I think she's going to be
bossing us around.

02:21.570 --> 02:23.780
That means she's reliable.

02:25.580 --> 02:27.120
Let's just go!

02:40.340 --> 02:42.800
There it is! Romos Castle!

02:45.430 --> 02:48.430
Okay! Romos Castle here we come!

02:50.690 --> 02:54.150
Go home! The king is already asleep!

02:54.320 --> 02:55.690
Come back tomorrow!

02:55.860 --> 02:59.860
Oh come on! We've come all this way!
Don't be like that!

03:00.570 --> 03:06.700
Sorry, but security at the castle
has been increased due to monster attacks.

03:07.330 --> 03:11.290
We cannot just allow anyone
in the castle at night.

03:11.830 --> 03:15.460
Listen, we happen
to know the king personally.

03:15.630 --> 03:17.960
You might get chewed out later.

03:18.130 --> 03:21.220
Keep up with the lies
and I'll have you thrown in prison!

03:21.380 --> 03:23.180
Get lost!

03:24.640 --> 03:29.560
Dammit! I was sure we'd finally get
some hospitality at the castle tonight.

03:29.730 --> 03:33.350
Oh well. Let's spend tonight in an inn.

03:33.810 --> 03:35.860
Oh. There.

03:37.320 --> 03:40.740
Welcome. It's quite late
to be out, isn't it?

03:41.400 --> 03:43.780
Um, the three of us
would like to spend the night.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.330
Huh? Just you three?

03:46.490 --> 03:48.370
Aren't there any adults?

03:48.740 --> 03:53.330
Mister, we may not look it,
but we're fighting the Dark Army.

03:54.420 --> 03:58.670
You could say we're a Hero's party.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.670
That's a coincidence.

04:00.840 --> 04:05.800
It just so happens there's another
Hero's party staying here.

04:05.970 --> 04:08.470
Huh? A Hero?! Really?

04:08.640 --> 04:11.640
There. They're staying in that room.

04:12.140 --> 04:14.400
Don't, Dai! Save it for tomorrow!

04:14.560 --> 04:17.770
Oh come on! I just want to say hello!

04:18.860 --> 04:21.280
Sir Hero! Sir Hero!

04:21.440 --> 04:23.400
What? It's late.

04:23.570 --> 04:26.160
I wanted to meet you!

04:26.320 --> 04:27.570
Go home!

04:27.740 --> 04:33.500
We're exhausted from
battling monsters all day!

04:34.830 --> 04:37.080
Can't I talk to you a little bit?!

04:37.250 --> 04:40.550
No! I'll sign an autograph tomorrow!

04:40.710 --> 04:42.460
What's going on? Who is that?

04:42.630 --> 04:44.300
Some annoying brat.

04:44.470 --> 04:46.890
I've heard that voice before.

04:47.050 --> 04:49.390
Hey, Sir Hero! Sir Hero!

04:49.560 --> 04:52.310
Enough! Buzz off!

04:54.180 --> 04:55.390
The fake Hero!

04:55.560 --> 04:58.190
Th-Th-The monster boy!

04:58.360 --> 04:59.520
Huh? What?

05:00.400 --> 05:02.650
What are you doing in Romos?!

05:05.240 --> 05:06.660
What's going on, Dai?!

05:06.820 --> 05:09.990
These guys are villains
pretending to be Heroes!

05:12.240 --> 05:16.830
<i>They kidnapped Gomechan
and did all sorts of bad stuff!</i>

05:17.790 --> 05:20.920
Hold on! We've washed
our hands of that stuff!

05:21.090 --> 05:27.180
That's right! We paid for our sins
and are working to be true Heroes!

05:27.340 --> 05:29.430
Working by doing what?

05:29.600 --> 05:34.310
Well, we defeat weaker monsters
and get rewards.

05:34.480 --> 05:38.650
And open leftover treasure chests
at the castles the Dark Army cleared.

05:38.810 --> 05:44.780
Coaching soldiers in fighting and magic
pays pretty well, too!

05:44.940 --> 05:45.820
That's right!

05:48.200 --> 05:49.620
Seriously?

05:49.780 --> 05:53.700
That's basically what you used to do.

05:53.870 --> 05:59.830
Honestly, how can anyone who only fights
weaker monsters call themselves a Hero?

06:00.290 --> 06:02.290
You're one to talk.

06:03.250 --> 06:06.260
Why don't we let bygones be bygones?

06:15.020 --> 06:18.230
<i>From here on, I must be ruthless.</i>

06:18.980 --> 06:23.730
<i>The pride and honor of a warrior
are meaningless without victory.</i>

06:31.320 --> 06:33.700
<i>I will use whatever method I can...</i>

06:36.120 --> 06:37.580
and kill him!

06:59.020 --> 07:00.560
Come out Dai!

07:01.310 --> 07:06.030
Otherwise, Romos Kingdom falls today!

07:10.860 --> 07:12.200
That voice...

07:19.660 --> 07:22.120
A massive army of monsters?!

07:23.040 --> 07:25.710
It must be Crocodine's Furfang Legion!

07:25.880 --> 07:28.340
They're launching an all-out attack.

07:28.760 --> 07:30.170
Hey! What is all that?!

07:30.800 --> 07:32.930
It's the Dark Army's Furfang Legion!

07:33.760 --> 07:34.720
The Furfang Legion?!

07:34.890 --> 07:39.480
An army of monsters this size
has never appeared before!

07:41.350 --> 07:42.650
It's Crocodine!

07:43.400 --> 07:46.770
Go forth! Wipe out Romos Castle!

07:48.110 --> 07:49.150
Crocodine...

07:49.320 --> 07:51.400
What is that thing?!

07:52.530 --> 07:54.240
He's headed for the castle!

08:00.000 --> 08:01.910
Dai, wait! Dai!

08:15.220 --> 08:16.300
Your Majesty!

08:16.470 --> 08:17.050
What is it?!

08:17.220 --> 08:21.890
It's no good! The enemy army
is overwhelming! We can't hold them!

08:24.140 --> 08:27.150
Our only option is
to help you escape, Your Majesty!

08:27.310 --> 08:29.570
I cannot abandon my people and flee!

08:30.400 --> 08:32.650
A king's desertion is the same as defeat!

08:32.820 --> 08:37.200
I may be old and weak,
but I will not turn tail and run!

08:37.370 --> 08:38.490
We must fight!

08:38.830 --> 08:40.830
We must hold out hope until the end!

08:41.410 --> 08:44.250
The gods offer no miracles
to those who retreat!

08:49.340 --> 08:50.710
Who goes there?!

08:51.090 --> 08:54.510
I am Legion Commander of
the Furfang Legion of the Dark Army...

08:56.550 --> 08:57.850
Crocodine!

08:59.300 --> 09:00.760
Curse you!

09:04.390 --> 09:09.610
King Romos, I have no interest
in your pathetic life.

09:10.150 --> 09:14.150
But I need you as bait
to lure out my target!

09:17.030 --> 09:18.700
We have to go after Dai!

09:18.870 --> 09:20.240
Huh?! Why?!

09:20.620 --> 09:22.950
Didn't you see Crocodine's eye?!

09:23.120 --> 09:26.000
He intends to kill Dai for revenge!

09:26.460 --> 09:27.580
We have to help!

09:27.750 --> 09:29.670
Count us out.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.960
Indeed.

09:31.130 --> 09:35.800
What's the point in fighting someone
you know you can't beat?

09:35.970 --> 09:39.760
There's no greater treasure
than one's own life after all!

09:40.800 --> 09:42.350
I can agree to that.

09:43.310 --> 09:46.140
Stop goofing around! Hurry!

09:46.310 --> 09:49.150
But Crocodine's really strong.

09:49.690 --> 09:52.440
It'll be like just going to die.

09:52.820 --> 09:56.990
That's why we have to help!
Dai might get killed!

09:57.150 --> 09:59.280
We all have to work together!

09:59.450 --> 10:01.530
Don't worry about it.

10:01.700 --> 10:04.870
Dai's super strong in a pinch.

10:05.040 --> 10:06.540
He won't die.

10:07.460 --> 10:08.460
Popp?

10:13.380 --> 10:18.130
What's with you, Popp?!
Aren't you Dai's friend?! His companion?!

10:18.300 --> 10:19.840
Don't you care about him?!

10:20.010 --> 10:25.890
Lay off me! I never wanted
to fight the Dark Army in the first place!

10:26.060 --> 10:27.600
I never wanted to fight!

10:29.520 --> 10:33.480
I mean, I know I trained together
with Dai and all.

10:34.320 --> 10:37.990
But he's the reason they keep coming.

10:39.450 --> 10:42.450
I don't want to end up
dying because of him.

10:48.870 --> 10:50.250
Ow...

10:50.870 --> 10:52.040
Why you...!

10:57.880 --> 10:59.170
Popp...

10:59.340 --> 11:00.550
Didn't...

11:02.180 --> 11:05.470
Didn't you learn anything
from Master Avan?!

11:06.520 --> 11:11.690
I thought you and Dai
were fighting to avenge him!

11:11.850 --> 11:15.190
That's why I followed you two.

11:16.110 --> 11:17.860
That's why I joined you two!

11:20.070 --> 11:21.490
Maam...

11:21.660 --> 11:23.820
You disgust me!

11:35.040 --> 11:37.550
MAGIC BULLET GUN

11:40.130 --> 11:42.550
KABOOM
EXPLOSION-TYPE SPELL

11:53.900 --> 11:55.020
Move!

11:59.780 --> 12:00.820
Stop!

12:01.320 --> 12:02.280
I'm the one you want!

12:02.450 --> 12:04.070
It can't be... That boy...

12:04.490 --> 12:06.950
There you are, Dai. I've been waiting.

12:07.580 --> 12:12.330
<i>Is it really Dai? He's grown up so much!</i>

12:12.500 --> 12:16.540
<i>The gods have given me a miracle
in the nick of time!</i>

12:19.130 --> 12:22.880
Fight to your heart's content, Crocodine!

12:23.050 --> 12:27.510
So long as you have that ace
up your sleeve, Dai can never win!

12:34.400 --> 12:38.570
What's wrong?! Fight me!
Otherwise...!

12:42.610 --> 12:43.610
Okay...

12:48.410 --> 12:49.200
Frizz!

12:49.370 --> 12:50.080
A spell?!

13:02.380 --> 13:06.090
<i>In our last battle,
Dai could only use a sword.</i>

13:06.260 --> 13:10.350
<i>Did he master Frizz in only a few days?!</i>

13:14.390 --> 13:18.060
<i>They say it only takes three days
for someone to change,</i>

13:18.230 --> 13:20.270
<i>and he really did!</i>

13:21.400 --> 13:28.450
<i>If he continues to grow, he'll become
the greatest threat to the Dark Army!</i>

13:29.660 --> 13:31.200
-Dai!
-Your Majesty!

13:31.620 --> 13:33.620
Maam, cast Midheal on the king!

13:33.790 --> 13:34.960
Got it!

13:39.250 --> 13:40.840
That's it, Crocodine.

13:41.500 --> 13:45.300
Throw away your pitiful pride and use it!

13:45.840 --> 13:50.600
Master Zaboera, what sort
of secret weapon is in that box?

13:51.970 --> 13:55.930
It contains that boy's greatest weakness.

13:56.390 --> 13:59.100
I didn't want to use this,
but you leave me no choice.

14:05.360 --> 14:07.030
That's a Magic Cylinder!

14:07.200 --> 14:08.450
A Magic Cylinder?

14:10.070 --> 14:15.290
<i>It can contain living creatures!
You can bring them in or out with a spell!</i>

14:16.250 --> 14:19.960
So it's like the Magic Bullets
that Master Avan made?!

14:20.130 --> 14:24.420
Yeah! It must contain some sort of backup!

14:25.630 --> 14:27.380
Come forth! Gush!

14:36.230 --> 14:37.350
Huh?! Grampa?!

14:44.150 --> 14:46.530
<i>Brass is Dai's adoptive parent.</i>

14:47.070 --> 14:49.410
He's a Lump Shaman.

14:49.910 --> 14:53.990
If he leaves his island and falls under
the Dark King's Magic Power,

14:54.160 --> 14:57.450
he instantly becomes
a vanguard for the Dark Army.

14:57.620 --> 15:00.790
Now go, Lump Shaman Brass!

15:02.380 --> 15:03.790
But...!

15:05.130 --> 15:06.460
That monster!

15:07.130 --> 15:08.130
Wait!

15:08.300 --> 15:09.970
That's my Grampa!

15:10.130 --> 15:11.180
What do you mean?!

15:11.840 --> 15:17.560
He raised me after I washed up
on his island! He's not a bad monster!

15:18.180 --> 15:19.690
Please wait!

15:19.850 --> 15:22.650
<i>He cannot harm his adoptive parent!</i>

15:23.610 --> 15:27.820
There's no one better to use against Dai!

15:32.280 --> 15:34.370
Fuddle!

15:37.490 --> 15:38.500
Hey! Are you okay?!

15:49.880 --> 15:50.800
What's wrong?!

15:50.970 --> 15:53.430
He had Fuddle cast on him
so he's confused!

15:55.050 --> 15:56.140
Hold him!

15:56.310 --> 15:56.970
Yes, Sire!

16:00.480 --> 16:02.310
Let me go! Let me go!

16:02.480 --> 16:05.610
Grampa, stop it!
Why are you doing this?!

16:13.280 --> 16:16.950
Grampa, wake up!
Don't you recognize me?!

16:21.580 --> 16:22.830
Darn it!

16:39.060 --> 16:40.430
Grampa...

16:41.930 --> 16:44.270
D-Dai...

16:44.900 --> 16:45.810
Grampa!

16:48.190 --> 16:49.860
Frizzle!

16:57.200 --> 16:58.580
Lord Hadlar.

16:58.740 --> 16:59.910
What is it?

17:00.080 --> 17:05.370
I have word from my master,
Mystic Bishop Zaboera.

17:05.960 --> 17:11.630
He is working with Commander Crocodine
of the Furfang Legion to fight Dai.

17:11.800 --> 17:14.300
He says victory is at hand.

17:14.680 --> 17:16.590
Understood. Leave me.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.220
Yes, Lord.

17:18.640 --> 17:21.810
Zaboera working together with Crocodine?

17:27.810 --> 17:30.360
<i>Curse that Dai.</i>

17:31.440 --> 17:36.320
<i>Already he's grown strong enough
that Crocodine can't handle him alone.</i>

17:36.820 --> 17:39.330
<i>But I suppose there's no worry.</i>

17:39.490 --> 17:43.120
<i>Not if Zaboera is lending his wisdom.</i>

17:43.620 --> 17:45.910
<i>In the Dark Army,</i>

17:46.080 --> 17:51.000
<i>he has the most cunning and cruel mind.</i>

17:51.170 --> 17:54.420
<i>He cannot be underestimated.</i>

18:08.100 --> 18:09.940
G-Grampa...

18:10.110 --> 18:12.320
I'm fine, young lady!

18:12.480 --> 18:14.570
Go help Dai!

18:17.740 --> 18:19.110
This is the end!

18:19.280 --> 18:20.070
Dai!

18:23.450 --> 18:24.580
You again?!

18:25.200 --> 18:27.410
I've got a Frizzle of my own for you!

18:27.960 --> 18:28.670
Don't!

18:28.830 --> 18:29.710
Dai?!

18:29.880 --> 18:32.130
Maam, you'll hit Grampa!

18:32.290 --> 18:33.840
But he'll kill you!

18:34.170 --> 18:38.050
Please... He's the only family I've got!

18:39.260 --> 18:40.340
He's...

18:41.260 --> 18:43.140
my Grampa!

18:47.850 --> 18:49.350
Brass, finish...

18:50.600 --> 18:53.150
Crocodine!
How can you call yourself a warrior?!

18:54.530 --> 19:00.360
After all that talk of pride, I thought
you'd be more honorable than that!

19:00.530 --> 19:03.700
You call yourself the Beast King?!
Don't make me laugh!

19:03.870 --> 19:05.410
That's right!

19:05.580 --> 19:08.410
Using a hostage against a little boy?!

19:08.580 --> 19:11.920
You're a disgrace of a warrior!
You should be ashamed!

19:12.080 --> 19:12.880
That's right!

19:13.040 --> 19:14.130
Shame on you!

19:14.290 --> 19:15.380
You're no warrior!

19:15.550 --> 19:17.880
Enough!

19:19.970 --> 19:23.600
A warrior without an achievement
is merely a beast with no teeth!

19:24.180 --> 19:26.180
Your words mean nothing!

19:27.220 --> 19:31.810
I've already abandoned my pride!

19:33.810 --> 19:35.480
He said it!

19:35.650 --> 19:38.490
Well said, Crocodine.

19:38.860 --> 19:43.820
With that attitude,
your victory is assured!

19:43.990 --> 19:48.580
Impressive, Master Zaboera.
To turn a Legion Commander into a pawn.

19:48.750 --> 19:55.090
Now if Crocodine wins,
your standing is sure to rise.

19:55.250 --> 19:58.670
After I set all this up,

19:58.840 --> 20:05.760
even a muscle-brained buffoon
like Crocodine can't lose.

20:07.970 --> 20:09.390
What can we do?

20:09.770 --> 20:10.850
The Magic Cylinder.

20:11.020 --> 20:11.890
Huh?

20:14.690 --> 20:18.070
If we can get that,
we can seal Grampa away again.

20:18.230 --> 20:22.280
You keep Grampa busy.
I'll go for the Cylinder.

20:22.450 --> 20:23.490
Got it.

20:25.320 --> 20:26.490
Frizzle!

20:40.380 --> 20:41.880
Too bad.

20:42.050 --> 20:48.430
It was a good plan, but your speed
was halved with the damage from Frizzle.

20:51.100 --> 20:53.310
D-Darn it!

20:54.350 --> 20:56.690
It's over, Dai!

20:58.360 --> 20:59.190
Dai!

21:01.490 --> 21:05.860
You won't suffer long. I'll end it now...

21:06.780 --> 21:10.290
with this, the Beast King Crocodine's
most powerful attack!

21:22.090 --> 21:25.970
<i>He's gathering all of his energy...
all of his aura into his right arm!</i>

21:26.140 --> 21:27.760
W-What is that?

21:28.470 --> 21:32.220
Beast King Anguish Blast!

21:37.270 --> 21:38.520
W-What's that?!

21:57.460 --> 21:59.630
Victory is mine!

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.180 --> 23:37.430
<i>Dai is overwhelmed by
Crocodine's incredible power.</i>

23:37.600 --> 23:41.980
<i>Maam is immobilized
by the Mystic Bishop Zaboera.</i>

23:42.150 --> 23:44.820
<i>The final blow bears down upon them.</i>

23:45.190 --> 23:48.820
<i>Meanwhile, Popp is far
from the battlefield.</i>

23:48.990 --> 23:52.610
<i>What does Popp feel
about his friends' peril?</i>

23:53.030 --> 23:56.200
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:56.370 --> 23:58.080
<i>"A Single Shard of Courage"</i>

23:58.250 --> 24:00.210
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

